#. module: cst_kerama_landed_cost
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:cst_kerama_landed_cost.field_cst_picking_expense__split_method
msgid ""
"By Value: goods carry the expense in proportion to what they cost.\n"
"By Quantity: every unit received carries the same share.\n"
"Equally: every product line carries the same share.\n"
"By Weight / By Volume: in proportion to the weight or volume received."
msgstr ""
"Narxi bo'yicha: tovarlar o'z qiymatiga mutanosib ravishda xarajat ko'taradi.\n"
"Soni bo'yicha: kelgan har bir birlik bir xil ulush ko'taradi.\n"
"Teng: har bir mahsulot qatori bir xil ulush ko'taradi.\n"
"Og'irligi / Hajmi bo'yicha: kelgan og'irlik yoki hajmga mutanosib."

