msgstr "Xarajatlar yig'indisi nolga teng - taqsimlashga hech narsa yo'q."

#. module: cst_kerama_landed_cost
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:cst_kerama_landed_cost.view_picking_form_landed_cost
msgid ""
"The providers will be billed and the expenses will be added to the cost of "
"the goods. This cannot be undone - a mistake has to be corrected with a "
"negative expense line. Continue?"
msgstr ""
"Xizmat ko'rsatuvchilarga schyot yaratiladi va xarajatlar tovar tannarxiga qo'shiladi. Buni bekor qilib bo'lmaydi - xatoni faqat manfiy summali xarajat qatori bilan tuzatiladi. Davom etasizmi?"

