#. module: cst_kerama_landed_cost
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:cst_kerama_landed_cost.field_stock_picking__cst_valuation_ok
msgid ""
"Whether any of the goods on this receipt is valued at average cost or FIFO."
"  Goods at standard price keep the price on their form whatever they cost to"
" bring in, so expenses cannot land on them."
msgstr ""
"Bu kirimdagi tovarlardan birortasi o'rtacha tannarx yoki FIFO bo'yicha baholanadimi. Standart narxdagi tovar keltirish qanchaga tushishidan qat'i nazar o'z kartochkasidagi narxda qoladi, shuning uchun unga xarajat tushmaydi."

#. module: cst_kerama_landed_cost
